3, 33, 33);">
I am not seeking a settlement and I will not be negotiating one. I will not=
 accept confidentiality over any part of this record. Everything in this ma=
tter is published and will remain published.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
